#: {{syn|en|typo}}
# {{lb|en|programming}} A value, as opposed to an [[identifier]], written into the [[source code]] of a computer program.
#: {{syn|en|literal constant}}
# {{lb|en|logic}} A [[propositional calculus|propositional]] [[variable]] or the [[negation]] of a propositional variable. <sup>{{w|Literal (mathematical logic)|Wp}}</sup>

